"maserati-ghibli-2016": {"variants":{"this":"Ghibli Diesel","ladder":["Ghibli Diesel"],"lines":["Maserati sold the Ghibli in India only as a diesel, in one version, at Rs 1.1 crore ex-showroom Delhi in 2015.","The 3.0 V6 diesel makes 275 PS and 600 Nm and drives the rear wheels through an 8-speed automatic.","The March 2018 update added GranLusso and GranSport versions above the plain Diesel, at Rs 1.33 to 1.42 crore."],"sources":[{"name":"Car India, Maserati Ghibli Diesel first drive review: specifications and India price (4 Aug 2015)","url":"https://carindia.in/poseidons-oil-burner-maserati-ghibli-diesel-first-drive-review/3/","as_of":"2026-10-15"},{"name":"CarTrade, Maserati launches 2018 Ghibli in India at Rs 1.33 crore (15 Mar 2018)","url":"https://www.cartrade.com/news/maserati-launches-2018-ghibli-in-india-at-rs-1-33-crores-135959.html","as_of":"2026-10-15"}]},"generation":{"this_car":"Third-generation Ghibli (M157), sold in India as a diesel from 2015. Production ended in December 2023 and Maserati sells no Ghibli today.","timeline":[{"year":"2013","text":"This Ghibli generation goes into production in Italy."},{"year":"2015","text":"On sale in India as the Ghibli Diesel, Rs 1.1 crore ex-showroom Delhi."},{"year":"Mar 2018","text":"Update: new grille, LED headlamps, electric power steering; GranLusso and GranSport added."},{"year":"Dec 2023","text":"Ghibli production ends."}],"sources":[{"name":"Wikipedia, Maserati Ghibli (M157): production dates","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maserati_Ghibli_(M157)","as_of":"2026-10-15"},{"name":"Car India, Maserati Ghibli Diesel first drive review: specifications and India price (4 Aug 2015)","url":"https://carindia.in/poseidons-oil-burner-maserati-ghibli-diesel-first-drive-review/3/","as_of":"2026-10-15"},{"name":"CarTrade, Maserati launches 2018 Ghibli in India at Rs 1.33 crore (15 Mar 2018)","url":"https://www.cartrade.com/news/maserati-launches-2018-ghibli-in-india-at-rs-1-33-crores-135959.html","as_of":"2026-10-15"}],"peek":"Third generation, before the 2018 update; Ghibli no longer made"}},
